    "body": "Fixes #40582 \r\n\r\n### Problem:\r\nWhen buffers are by default `nomodifiable`, such as when Nvim starts with `-M`, the checkhealth buffer cannot be updated.\r\n\r\n### Solution:\r\nAlways set `modifiable` before modifying the checkhealth buffer.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-05T10:09:28Z",
